; Not vendored — see previews/README.md.
;
; The candle instanced at the middle of the project viewport over a neutral
; backdrop. The sub-scene itself sits at the origin, so captured alone it falls
; off the top-left corner and both sides render an empty frame.
;
; The backdrop takes both of the candle's lights: they carry
; range_item_cull_mask 145 and 17, and a Polygon2D's default light_mask of 1 is
; in each. So this frames the warm pool AND the Sprite2D wick.

